;        >Total Merchantable Volume(m³/ha): 
;            +Number of Plots = 113; R² = 000.356; Standard Error = 40.438
;            +Model Formula:  Y = ( B1 +B4*X2+B5*X3+B6*X4+B7*X5+B8*X6 ) * ( X1 - B0 )^B2 * EXP( B3 * ( X1 - B0 ) )
;                -Where: Y=t_mervol,X1=plotage,X2=dm_er1,X3=dm_er2,X4=dm_sc1,X5=dm_sc2,X6=dm_cc1
;            +Parameter Values: 
;                -B1 = 20.000000|©;-B2 = 004.642706|®;-B3 = 001.046200|©
;                -B4 = -0.014860|©;-B5 = 001.781658|®;-B6 = 001.133661|®
;                -B7 = -1.922249|®;-B8 = -2.374929|®;-B9 = -0.865079|®
;    -Component Mapping:  
;        >White Spruce: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Spruce * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Black Spruce: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Black Spruce * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Balsam Fir: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Balsam Fir * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >White Pine: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Pine * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Tamarack Larch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Tamarack Larch * [1+(|Softwood-(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+
;                 +|Tamarack Larch))/(|White Spruce+|Black Spruce+|Balsam Fir+|White Pine+|Tamarack Larch)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >White Birch: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -White Birch * [1+(|Hardwood-(|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen))/(|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen)] *
;                 * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
;        >Trembling Aspen: 
;            +Method Used: Calculation
;            +Component(s)/Formula Used: 
;                -Trembling Aspen * [1+(|Hardwood-(|White Birch+|Trembling Aspen))/(|White Birch+
;                 +|Trembling Aspen)] * [1+(|Total-(|Softwood+|Hardwood))/(|Softwood+|Hardwood)]rag@80
